<!-- ============================================
     ABOUT — 01. OUR MISSION
     Visual: an orbital "intelligence core" composition — no approved
     illustration asset exists in the repo, so this is built in
     HTML/SVG using only existing brand colors and the real MedhaIQ
     mark (medhaiq-icon.png, already used in the header/footer — not a
     new or generated logo). Reuses the same outline-icon language as
     the Principles cards further down the page.
     ============================================ -->
<section class="mh-about-section mh-about-mission" id="mission">
  <div class="mh-about-inner mh-about-mission-grid">
    <div class="mh-about-mission-copy">
      <div class="mh-eyebrow">01 — Our Mission</div>
      <h2 class="mh-about-mission-statement">Building the Career Operating System for the AI Era.</h2>
      <p>MedhaIQ exists to give professionals the intelligence, clarity, and communication capability to navigate high-stakes career moments with confidence.</p>
      <p>We believe career progression should be driven by capability, preparation, and continuous growth — not chance. From early-career transitions to executive leadership, MedhaIQ is building a more intelligent way to navigate the moments that shape a career.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mh-about-mission-visual" aria-hidden="true">
